      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bright & Spacious Ground Floor Apartment in Beverton Court\r\nNo. 11 Beverton Court is a bright and spacious one-bedroom ground floor apartment, ideally situated within this mature and well-established development. Recently upgraded with a newly fitted kitchen and modern wet room, the apartment offers comfortable, low-maintenance living in a convenient location.\r\nBeverton Court comprises 76 apartments set on 2.75 arces approximately with beautifully maintained landscaped gardens, creating a pleasant and peaceful setting.\r\nThe location is particularly appealing, with Newbridge Park just a short walk away, accessed via the pedestrian entrance opposite the main entrance to the development. Donabate Village and Donabate Train Station are also within easy walking distance, providing excellent access to local amenities, shops, cafés and public transport.\r\nFor commuters, the property is ideally positioned for access to the Dublin/Belfast motorway, with Dublin City approximately 25 minutes by train and Dublin Airport approximately 10 minutes by car.\r\nWhether you are looking to take your first step onto the property ladder or seeking a comfortable home with less maintenance as you downsize, No. 11 offers an excellent opportunity in a highly convenient location"
      },
